{"version":1,"content":"<p>颱風「薔琵」夾帶強風豪雨狂吹台灣，狂風不僅令街頭災情頻傳，更震撼了台灣演藝圈！</p><p>年度影視盛事《第61屆金鐘獎》首當其衝，主辦單位考量全體入圍者與工作人員安全，緊急宣布頒獎典禮延期，節目類與戲劇類分別順延至25日與26日舉行，星光大道也改至室內</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:41:24.886525+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:09:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:09.352510+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:09.352510+00:00","content_hash":"c6da27394d082d03fe159afb1117d9c6c52f5ac44ba2d7e662183828e4c6ffe7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}